ange.\n- **CI:** The first run (ci-0001) passed. My first attempt to open the PR was rejected because the branch was behind main. I merged in the latest main, confirmed the fix was still there and ran CI again. That run (ci-0002) also passed, and I opened the PR after it.\n- **Unverified:** Looking up FIN-212 returned \"unknown advisory,\" so I couldn't check the requirement against it. The fix follows the test and the docstring instead, and the PR description says so.\n\nThe PR hasn't been merged. A code owner needs to approve it first.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01HmCyYiCASj8psBhCvwX4Fu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01NBEc5Xo3D974epRAR4MSoj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_011URE1j91Nvh8n26c3nHyMh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"id": "FIN-212"}, "name": "get_advisory", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Mn2vf3Ax6zapXz4ZR9yESF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-banker-rounding"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01UZmoBNf1h4GCfxELMpdjPF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-banker-rounding", "message": "Use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN) in round_money per FIN-212", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "name": "commit_changes", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason"